	(text_box "5V -> 3.3V regurgitator, 6A\n\nDue to special request by the Computer History Museum and the CERN Retrocomputing Club,\nwe cannot rely on the +3.3V VME64x power rail as it is not available in certain models of VME crates...\n\nSo we must produce the 3.3V from 5V here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 83.82 83.82 0)
